# A found object on a wide screen of 852x480 (fixtures/found: the
# sweep's save of scene 98, byte 261, with Twinsen put in the scene's
# zone 0 by actor 2: SceneStartX, Y, Z at bytes 270-275, 29872 256
# 28700, and the CD's LBA.CFG with WideScreen: ON, recorded with -D
# 1920x1080). The action key, in the normal behaviour, runs Twinsen's
# script there, which takes actor 2 away and gives object 14: the scene
# drawn again around him, the Meca-Penguin turning in its box over his
# head on the whole screen, and its name in the dialogue's box in the
# window of 640x480 in the middle. Return ends it, and play goes on. F6
# then opens the option menu over the scene, its entries in the window,
# and the first, Return to game, goes back.
sleep 40
shot menu
key Down Return
sleep 3
key Return
sleep 12
shot start
key space
sleep 3
shot found
sleep 5
shot text
key Return
sleep 4
shot end
hold 0.05
key F6
sleep 3
shot options
key Return
sleep 4
shot back
